# Complete flight test script: from boot to takeoff and steering in 3D flight scene
# 1. Boot to title
wait 220
press start 5

# 2. Title to club registration / password prompt
wait 120
press start 5

# 3. Password prompt -> confirm "NO"
wait 200
press a 5
wait 60
press a 5
wait 60
press start 5

# 4. Lesson 1 Briefing (Tony)
wait 200
press a 5
wait 60
press start 5
wait 60
press a 5
wait 60
press start 5

# 5. Event Select -> Select "LIGHT PLANE" with B, then confirm with START
wait 60
press b 5
wait 60
press start 5

# 6. Flight Curriculum / Controls screen -> Start Flight
wait 120
press start 5
wait 60
press a 5
wait 60
press start 5

# 7. Runway / Takeoff: 3D Flight Scene
# Wait for 3D flight scene to initialize
wait 120

# Full throttle down the runway
press a 120
wait 30

# Pull back stick (DOWN) to take off
press a+down 90
wait 30

# Bank right in mid-air
press a+right 90
wait 60

quit
